From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Xilin Wu <sophon@radxa.com>
Date: Wed, 24 Jun 2026 17:14:20 +0800
Subject: arm64: dts: qcom: sc8280xp: Add missing QUP UART nodes

SC8280XP already describes I2C and SPI nodes for each QUP serial engine,
but most of the corresponding UART nodes are missing.

Add the missing GENI UART nodes with the same register, clock, interrupt,
power-domain and interconnect resources as their matching QUP engines.
Keep the nodes disabled by default and reference the common QUP UART
pinctrl states for regular UARTs. Leave uart17 without a pinctrl state as
it is used as a debug UART.

Signed-off-by: Xilin Wu <sophon@radxa.com>
---
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sc8280xp.dtsi | 378 ++++++++++
 1 file changed, 378 insertions(+)

